WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:42.114 --> 00:00:43.817
Our goal
is to ensure that

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:46.411
all soil ecosystems
in the EU

00:00:46.491 --> 00:00:49.451
are healthy and resilient
by 2050.

00:00:49.542 --> 00:00:51.165
This is not a luxury.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:53.540
It is essential
to fight climate change,

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:56.171
ensure our forests
are healthy,

00:00:56.377 --> 00:00:59.302
our water clean
and our land rich,

00:00:59.485 --> 00:01:01.577
fertile and resilient

00:01:01.897 --> 00:01:04.640
for the future
of our farmers

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:06.640
and Europe’s food security.

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:09.531
This thin layer
under our feet

00:01:09.645 --> 00:01:11.000
that we barely notice

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.468
is the foundation
of our wellbeing.

00:01:15.234 --> 00:01:16.700
It is what gives life

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:19.611
to everything that grows
in our planet.

00:01:20.114 --> 00:01:22.148
Let us make sure
we protect it.

